{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1059069/block/singleImage/3241957/df/01KERVKJPXX59KZZY9HVN7HPTH.JPG?updatedAt=1792313245\"/><figcaption>伊利沙伯醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>伊利沙伯醫院發生虐兒案。 今日（18日）早上10時43分，一名父親發現6個月大女兒身上有傷痕，翻看家中閉路電視片段後，發現女兒曾遭家傭虐打。他帶女兒到伊利沙伯醫院求醫兼報警求助。警方接報後到場調查，相信女嬰曾遭人掌擱，以涉嫌「虐兒」罪拘捕一名女傭。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T09:19:32.458280+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:38:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:44.192714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:41.874036+00:00","content_hash":"1dd4eed1aba93ed8787d6b266385d2abfa8bd52a32be095e8d19a38517dd1e3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}